// Built like words-bulk.js / words-bulk-2.js and stored the same way - ALREADY
// NORMALIZED: every final letter is written in its regular form (מילים ->
// מילימ), which is what normalizeFinals() produces and how the board is built.
//
// How the list was built (scripted, not hand-typed):
//   * candidates came from the FrequencyWords Hebrew list (OpenSubtitles 2018,
//     he_full) in descending order of real-world usage - the 20,000 most
//     common words the game didn't know yet;
//   * each one had to be a word of the hspell / LibreOffice he_IL spell-check
//     dictionary as listed (not a prefix-generated form);
//   * no length cap. Words of 6+ letters can't fit the 5x5 board, so they are
//     only findable in מגדל זבאנג (tower.js); the square-board code already
//     skips words longer than the grid;
//   * anything already in HEBREW_DICTIONARY, EXTRA_WORDS, EXTRA_WORDS_BULK or
//     EXTRA_WORDS_BULK_2 was skipped, and the pack is de-duplicated AFTER
//     normalization;
//   * vulgar / adult entries were filtered out.
//
// Merged by mergeExtraWords() in game.js. Scores come from pointsForWord():
// 3 letters = 100, 4 = 250, 5 and up = 500.
// ============================================================================

